---
import { FOOTER_LINKS, LEGAL_LINKS, SOCIALS } from '../../data/site';

const year = new Date().getFullYear();
---

<footer class="theme-fixed bg-night text-white">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1500px] px-4 pt-[72px] pb-10 md:px-8 lg:px-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-x-8 gap-y-10 md:grid-cols-4 lg:grid-cols-[1.6fr_repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr))]">
      <div class="col-span-full flex flex-col gap-5 lg:col-span-1">
        <img
          src="/vent-logo.svg"
          alt="Vent"
          width="128"
          height="30"
          class="h-[30px] w-auto self-start brightness-0 invert"
        />
        <p class="m-0 max-w-[380px] text-[15px] leading-[1.55] text-white">
          Vent is the smartest way to use crypto in Nigeria and Ghana! Sell, store or spend crypto with Africa's most
          trusted crypto platform.
        </p>
        <span class="mt-2 text-[13px] leading-none font-bold tracking-[0.06em] text-white">CONNECT WITH US</span>
        <ul class="m-0 flex list-none flex-wrap gap-2.5 p-0">
          {
            SOCIALS.map((s) => (
              <li>
                <a
                  href={s.href}
                  aria-label={s.label}
                  title={s.label}
                  class="grid size-11 place-items-center rounded-full border border-white/12 bg-night-tile text-[13px] leading-none font-bold text-white! no-underline transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-brand-500 hover:text-white!"
                >
                  {s.glyph}
                </a>
              </li>
            ))
          }
        </ul>
      </div>
      {
        FOOTER_LINKS.map((col) => (
          <nav aria-label={col.title.toLowerCase()} class="flex flex-col gap-[18px]">
            <span class="text-sm leading-none font-medium tracking-[0.04em] text-night-muted">{col.title}</span>
            {col.links.map((l) => (
              <a
                href={l === 'Blog' ? '/' : '#'}
                class="text-base leading-[1.3] text-white! no-underline transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-brand-500!"
              >
                {l}
              </a>
            ))}
          </nav>
        ))
      }
    </div>

    <div class="mt-14 flex max-w-[1000px] flex-col gap-4 text-sm leading-[1.6] text-night-text">
      <p class="m-0">
        Vent Finance Limited is incorporated in Canada with Business Number 725683239 and is registered with the
        Financial Transactions and Reports Analysis Centre of Canada (FINTRAC) as a Money Services Business (MSB). In
        Nigeria, Vent operates through Vent Africa Limited, incorporated under the laws of the Federal Republic of
        Nigeria with RC Number 9081680, and is registered with the Nigerian Financial Intelligence Unit (NFIU).
      </p>
      <p class="m-0">
        Vent is a technology and financial services platform, not a bank, broker or investment adviser. Nothing on the
        platform constitutes investment or financial advice. Cryptocurrency assets are volatile and may increase or
        decrease significantly in value.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div
      class="mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-6 gap-y-4 border-t border-white/12 pt-6 text-sm leading-[1.4] text-night-text"
    >
      <span class="min-w-[200px] flex-1">© {year} Vent Africa. All rights reserved.</span>
      {
        LEGAL_LINKS.map((l) => (
          <a href="#" class="text-white! no-underline transition-colors duration-150 hover:text-brand-500!">
            {l}
          </a>
        ))
      }
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
